OL,5,G1900 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FOn the night shift, PCs see a
OL,8,     Fdriver with his foot down in a
OL,9,     Ftop-of-the-range vehicle. And
OL,10,     Fafter spotting some cops, a man
OL,11,     Fditches his wheels to make off on
OL,12,     Ffoot.
OL,13,G2000 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,14,G     Speeders
OL,15,     FOfficers race to catch a reckless
OL,16,     Fjoyrider who refuses to stop. As
OL,17,     Fthe cops close in, the suspects
OL,18,     Frun for it after crashing the car
OL,19,     Fand it bursts into flames.
